---
title: "v2_add (Sui Framework: deny_list)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_config: per_type_config_entry!(deny_list, per_type_index, per_type_key, ctx)
    q_get_config --> q_check_exists: check if per_type_config exists
    q_check_exists --> q_create: does not exist
    q_create --> q_add_config: add_per_type_config(deny_list, index, key, ctx)
    q_add_config --> q_borrow: borrow_per_type_config_mut()
    q_check_exists --> q_borrow: already exists
    q_borrow --> q_set_entry: entry!(config, AddressKey(addr), default=true)
    q_set_entry --> q_update: next_epoch_entry = true
    q_update --> [*]: address denied for next epoch

    note right of q_set_entry
        INV-001: per-type config stored as dynamic object field
        INV-002: deny takes effect at next epoch for receiving
        INV-003: ConfigWriteCap ensures only deny_list module can modify
        INV-004: reserved addresses cannot be denied (checked at coin layer)
    end note
